\title{Recurrences in Disco}
\date{2026-03-18T13:16:57Z}
\tag{discrete}
\tag{draft}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{Since a [sequence](00B1) is formally defined as a function, we can easily define sequences in Disco.}

\transclude{00BP}

\p{We can also define sequences via [recurrence](00BA), simply by defining a Disco function that calls itself.}

\transclude{00BQ}
\transclude{00BR}
